sv2ghdl licensing
=================

Copyright (C) 2024-2026 Kevin Cameron

Everything in this repository is licensed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version
(SPDX: GPL-3.0-or-later). The full text is in COPYING. This includes
sv2ghdl, its wrappers and shims, and the vamos driver.

EXCEPTION: bfit/
  The bfit/ directory (the behavioral-fit accelerator) is NOT covered by the
  GPL. It is licensed under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0
  (SPDX: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0). See bfit/LICENSE. Commercial use of
  bfit requires a separate license from the copyright holder.

  The GPL-licensed code in this repository does not import or link bfit. It
  only invokes bfit as a separate program. The two remain separate works.

EXCEPTION: third-party test fixtures
  Test fixtures under tests/ that come from other projects keep their own
  licences: x-heep's adc.sp and control.init in tests/vamos/fixtures (one
  copy named init_xheep_control.init) are Apache-2.0, with the licence text
  in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt, and the 65nm_bulk.pm model cards there are
  derived from the Predictive Technology Model's 65 nm bulk card
  (http://ptm.asu.edu/), whose terms ask every user to acknowledge that URL
  and PTM's publications, as tests/vamos/fixtures/README does.

Earlier releases: revisions published before this file was added were
distributed under "GPL v2+" (see README). Anyone who received those revisions
keeps those terms. The licensing above applies from this revision onward.
